<title>UK: GUS shares fall as Warburg places stock.</title>
<headline>GUS shares fall as Warburg places stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker SBC Warburg was placing two million shares in home shopping group Great Universal Stores plc on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;They've been very active in the market today,&quot; commented one of the dealers.</p>
<p>Market sources said the shares were being placed at around 605p. The stock was down 15-1/2p at 608p by 0934 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
